      "content": "you talk about letting the weight go, but how? i dont mean just sleeping or something. i mean the actual weight of me. seeing them smile when i walk into the room and then seeing it fade... it's just so much kinder to them if i wasn't even a thing they had to account for. wouldn't it be more peaceful for them if i just stopped being a problem?",
